{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32365","headline":"寄岳州李外郎远 · 温庭筠","name":"寄岳州李外郎远","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"含嚬不语坐持颐，天远楼高宋玉悲。\n湖上残棊人散後，岳阳微雨鸟来迟。\n早梅犹得廻歌扇，春水还应理钓丝。\n独有袁宏正憔悴，一罇惆怅落花时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32365.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32365","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}